    "## Part 3: Sessions (memory)\n",
    "\n",
    "Within a Runner.run() application level turn, the conversation history is maintained.\n",
    "\n",
    "But each call to Runner.run() is a fresh start.\n",
    "\n",
    "Let's see that:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "agent = Agent(name=\"Assistant\", model=\"gpt-5.4-mini\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "response = await Runner.run(agent, \"Hi there. My name is Ed.\")\n",
    "print(response.final_output)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "response = await Runner.run(agent, \"What's my name?\")\n",
    "print(response.final_output)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Memory approach 1 - just manually pass in the list of dicts"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "response = await Runner.run(agent, \"Hi there. My name is Ed.\")\n",
    "print(response.final_output)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "response.to_input_list()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "next_input = response.to_input_list() + [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"What's my name?\"}]\n",
    "next_input"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "response = await Runner.run(agent, next_input)\n",
    "print(response.final_output)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Another approach - use OpenAI Agents SDK built in SQLLite session"
